{"id":"recpp7ejq2skyq4itouduk453","title":"休斯研究院的工作经历","originalTitle":"我在休斯研究院的一年半","summary":"许秋雨在1995年2月至1996年8月于休斯研究院工作，主要研究MPEG-4和2G标准。他每周工作六天，每天在办公室待十多个小时，期间完成了关于向量网格编码调制的专利研究，并参加了国际会议。离开HRL后，他于1996年8月底加入特拉华大学。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3395313&do=blog&id=1560070"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T00:14:44.180Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T00:14:44.180Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":16,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}